        <tr > 
          <td height="320" colspan="2"> 
            <div align="justify"><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"><font size="2" face="Arial">With 
              effect from Monday, the January 17, 2005, all visa applications 
              for Nigeria have to be deposited at the visa facilitation centre 
              designated by the <b>"High Commission of the Federal Republic of 
              Nigeria" - New Delhi</b> whose name and address are given hereunder:</font><b><font size="2" face="Arial"><br>
              <br>
              Travel Pals <br>
              Safdarjung Enclave, New Delhi - 110029 <br>
              <br>
              </font></b><font size="2" face="Arial">The centre through its representative 
              will deliver the applications to the high commission on behalf of 
              the agents and their applicants. </font><b><font size="2" face="Arial"><br>
              <br>
              The total cost for each visa application apart from visa fee shall 
              be Rs.1, 500 /- now which includes Rs.750 /- as administrative charges 
              or handling charges of "Travel Pals"as per Nigerian High Commission 
              & Udaan will levy Rs.750 /- as service charges for all Visa Applications 
              for Nigeria. <br>
              </font></b><font size="2" face="Arial"><br>
              Please note that all the above fees are exclusive of the service 
              taxes and also non-refundable irrespective of the visa granted or 
              not. </font></font></div>
          </td>
        </tr>
